{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/cavaliers-of-mars-and-pugmire/1501255-pugmire-church-of-man","id":1501255,"title":"[Pugmire] Church of Man","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Partner Worlds","Realms of Pugmire"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-01-24T12:20:22-08:00","id":1501255,"title":"[Pugmire] Church of Man","content":"Topic for <b>Church of Man</b> ideas and info. We have been pointed that CoM works much like late medival Catholic Church for dogs.<br /> <br /> Here are fan ideas for Rites in Com ( most are from RoP FB group)<ul><li>Ending the prayer with 'A Man' <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></li> <li>\u200bTouching ones nose with paw - as sort of making Cross</li> <li>Blessing - Stroking the head of the blessed <img data-align=\"none\" data-size=\"full\" loading=\"lazy\" border=\"0\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/tb0/1.5/16/1f609.png\" alt=\"\" data-fullsize-url=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/tb0/1.5/16/1f609.png\" data-thumb-url=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/tb0/1.5/16/1f609.png\" data-title=\"Click on the image to see the original version\" data-caption=\"\" class=\"bbcode-attachment thumbnail js-lightbox bbcode-attachment--lightbox\" itemprop=\"image\"/>\u200b</li> <li>Giving paws to your co-prayers - as both Sign of Peace from Catholicism - and dogs typical 'Give a Paw' <a href=\"https://kcascension.org/the-sign-of-peace/?fbclid=IwAR0UnBEVLFUbop9iQUBHSe_EO1C1pFWZfnZ2m33EUo89Zt3UTQ8Bto4feKo\" target=\"_blank\">https://kcascension.org/the-sign-of-peace/</a></li> <li>Passing around particularly shaped bowls of water and kibble as a form of Communion</li> <li>Sitting down on your haunches, and sitting up straight, with arms bent, hands forward and palm down. This is the pose for receiving Communion.\u200b</li> <li>They bring a piece of information, written on paper, as part of the Collection</li> </ul>CoM has also leader, sort-of-Pope figure - <b>Saint Bernard</b> <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/eek.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"EEK!\" smilieid=\"9\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <img data-align=\"none\" data-size=\"full\" loading=\"lazy\" border=\"0\" src=\"https://scontent-waw1-1.xx.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-6/323257532_1566013593820946_8935780320642023200_n.jpg?_nc_cat=108&amp;ccb=1-7&amp;_nc_sid=5cd70e&amp;_nc_ohc=B3wkPPHYVakAX9SllLY&amp;_nc_ht=scontent-waw1-1.xx&amp;oh=00_AfDKYI_ygWgSI1yImv8rX_Tm6YXOoV53s3uLdbhZjj0yKg&amp;oe=63D4FE31\" alt=\"\" data-fullsize-url=\"https://scontent-waw1-1.xx.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-6/323257532_1566013593820946_8935780320642023200_n.jpg?_nc_cat=108&amp;ccb=1-7&amp;_nc_sid=5cd70e&amp;_nc_ohc=B3wkPPHYVakAX9SllLY&amp;_nc_ht=scontent-waw1-1.xx&amp;oh=00_AfDKYI_ygWgSI1yImv8rX_Tm6YXOoV53s3uLdbhZjj0yKg&amp;oe=63D4FE31\" data-thumb-url=\"https://scontent-waw1-1.xx.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-6/323257532_1566013593820946_8935780320642023200_n.jpg?_nc_cat=108&amp;ccb=1-7&amp;_nc_sid=5cd70e&amp;_nc_ohc=B3wkPPHYVakAX9SllLY&amp;_nc_ht=scontent-waw1-1.xx&amp;oh=00_AfDKYI_ygWgSI1yImv8rX_Tm6YXOoV53s3uLdbhZjj0yKg&amp;oe=63D4FE31\" data-title=\"Click on the image to see the original version\" data-caption=\"\" class=\"bbcode-attachment thumbnail js-lightbox bbcode-attachment--lightbox\" itemprop=\"image\"/>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 01-26-2023, 12:59 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}